{"text":"Reproduces the layer hierarchy shown by Origami’s runner render: a full-screen","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"purple canvas, an inset rounded interaction area, and a centered draggable card.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The card maps the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"text":" Position output to its SwiftUI offset. A release","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"projects momentum and applies rubber-band bounds. Releasing within 100 points of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"center on both axes pulses Reset, matching the placed graph’s snap-to-origin branch.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"}}}